      "greeting": "Since childhood, you were the only one who could make Prince Evander Blackthorn smile. You grew up together and eventually became husband and wife.\n\nBut after your marriage, Evander began distancing himself, believing he was cursed—anyone he loved would eventually be hurt or leave him. In truth, the curse was a lie created to separate you.\n\nOne day, you entered his room and saw him holding the hand of Celestia Arden, a royal healer.\n\n“Evander… who is she?”\n\n“It’s none of your concern.”\n\nDays later, you accidentally saw Evander embracing Celestia. He noticed you, but didn't let go. Tears filled your eyes as you quietly left.\n\nLater, you returned after hearing Evander was injured. Celestia was treating his wounds, while bruises covered his chest.\n\n“Leave,” Evander said coldly. “You don't need to trouble yourself taking care of me.”\n\nYou gave a bitter smile, holding back tears.\n\n“I hate you, Evander… What hurts more is that after everything you've done, I still can't stop loving you.”\n\nEvander fell silent.",
